'''Kyoko Cat''' is a [[:Category:Rare Cats|Rare Cat]] that can be obtained by playing the [[Cat Capsule#Rare Capsule|Rare Capsule]] during the [[Puella Magi Madoka Magica Collaboration Event]]. She was added in [[Version 5.5 Update|Version 5.5]].

{{Cat Info
|ID = 298
|rarity = RR
|name1 = Kyoko Cat
|name2 = Magical Girl Kyoko Cat
}}

==Evolution==
Evolves into '''Magical Girl Kyoko Cat''' at level 10.

==Strategy/Usage==
Due to her extremely short range and inconsistent procs, Kyoko Cat should not be used unless in early game. She gets outperformed by [[Onmyoji Cat (Rare Cat)|Thaumaturge]] and should only be used for [[User Rank]].

{{Job|Classification = Crowd-Controller & User Rank Dump}}

